{"4296860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BunnyFly: Season of Summer", "steam_appid": 4296860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.poster.avif?t=1779720006\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.webm?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.mp4?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a little mysterious island in the middle of an isolated unknown lake, strange creatures exist. <strong><i>Bunnyflies</i></strong>! Little <i>bunny-like</i> creatures with wings like a <i>butterfly</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They <strong>fly</strong> and <strong>collect pollen</strong> to <strong>chew</strong> and bring back to their different hives as <i>honey</i> or <i>wax</i>, where one <strong>queen</strong> exists to help them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this island as <strong><i>Princess Honeybun</i></strong>, the queen's daughter who's now old enough to make her own hive and start her own colony! Help the residents, collect <strong>Royal Jelly</strong>, and become the next bunny matriarch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was originally created for the GMTK 2025 Game Jam, and has been expanded to have better visuals, performance, more mechanics, a much larger and complex world, higher variety of flowers, characters, a few mini-biomes, and a lot more lore to try and find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Open World set in low poly 3D! A collect-a-thon where exploration and figuring out how things work are the way to succeed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique flight gameplay system! Bounce through the sky with aerial maneuvers where each wing is controlled individually, with mastery of flight as you improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resource system using pollen! Collect pollen from flowers, then chew to convert it into honey or wax to be shared and used for the benefit of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of things to find! It wouldn't be fun if you couldn't search for collectables. There are 40 Royal Jellies to locate, try finding them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing and cozy world! The world is meant to be one of curiosity, exploration, and taking your time however you wish. That doesn't mean it's a casual experience, though!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying non-linear experience! The game is fully open with only one final goal which can be tackled at any time. There's no correct order!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.poster.avif?t=1779720006\" width=1170 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.webm?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.mp4?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.poster.avif?t=1779720006\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.webm?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/fcb2946c99219e469c2c5915487b207b.mp4?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a little mysterious island in the middle of an isolated unknown lake, strange creatures exist. <strong><i>Bunnyflies</i></strong>! Little <i>bunny-like</i> creatures with wings like a <i>butterfly</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They <strong>fly</strong> and <strong>collect pollen</strong> to <strong>chew</strong> and bring back to their different hives as <i>honey</i> or <i>wax</i>, where one <strong>queen</strong> exists to help them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this island as <strong><i>Princess Honeybun</i></strong>, the queen's daughter who's now old enough to make her own hive and start her own colony! Help the residents, collect <strong>Royal Jelly</strong>, and become the next bunny matriarch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was originally created for the GMTK 2025 Game Jam, and has been expanded to have better visuals, performance, more mechanics, a much larger and complex world, higher variety of flowers, characters, a few mini-biomes, and a lot more lore to try and find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Open World set in low poly 3D! A collect-a-thon where exploration and figuring out how things work are the way to succeed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique flight gameplay system! Bounce through the sky with aerial maneuvers where each wing is controlled individually, with mastery of flight as you improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resource system using pollen! Collect pollen from flowers, then chew to convert it into honey or wax to be shared and used for the benefit of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of things to find! It wouldn't be fun if you couldn't search for collectables. There are 40 Royal Jellies to locate, try finding them all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing and cozy world! The world is meant to be one of curiosity, exploration, and taking your time however you wish. That doesn't mean it's a casual experience, though!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying non-linear experience! The game is fully open with only one final goal which can be tackled at any time. There's no correct order!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.poster.avif?t=1779720006\" width=1170 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.webm?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/extras/dd77b71d25407bfa522bca570e9671b7.mp4?t=1779720006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fly in a relaxing world as a rare BunnyFly in this cozy collectathon! Master your flight, collect pollen, and create honey or wax to share with others. Collect Royal Jelly to strengthen your cheeks and become the next BunnyFly Queen!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296860/66b49bf4b2ce8bbb2d4f27f0de79cbbf83dad6b3/header.jpg?t=1779720006", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamsta